{"id":"49824451b79d11fa","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialMap.md","title":"SimplicialMap","display":"SimplicialMap","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SimplicialMap","parameters":["X","R","Y","S","f"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SimplicialMap"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>X</span><span>R</span><span>Y</span><span>S</span><span>f</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小单纯映射。有序参数：<code>X</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>Y</code>、<code>S</code>、<code>f</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SimplicialMap X R Y S f)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ SimplicialSet X R)\n  (and\n    (@ SimplicialSet Y S)\n    (and\n      (exists w (and (@ Omega w) (@ FunDom f w)))\n      (and\n        (forall n\n          (implies\n            (@ Nat n)\n            (exists A\n              (exists B (exists h (and (@ App X n A) (and (@ App Y n B) (and (@ App f n h) (@ Map h A B)))))))))\n        (forall m\n          (forall n\n            (forall a\n              (implies\n                (@ DeltaArrow m n a)\n                (exists xr\n                  (exists ys\n                    (exists fm\n                      (exists fn\n                        (exists left\n                          (exists right\n                            (and\n                            (@ SimpRestriction R m n a xr)\n                            (and\n                            (@ SimpRestriction S m n a ys)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App f m fm)\n                            (and (@ App f n fn) (and (@ Compose xr fm left) (and (@ Compose fn ys right) (= left right)))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"577620d5d7b63059\" href=\"?note=577620d5d7b63059\" title=\"ZFC_Compose\">Compose</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"214537992e13e711\" href=\"?note=214537992e13e711\" title=\"ZFC_DeltaArrow\">DeltaArrow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" href=\"?note=bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" title=\"ZFC_SimpRestriction\">SimpRestriction</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"85c9ab4a34ec968f\" href=\"?note=85c9ab4a34ec968f\" title=\"ZFC_SimplicialSet\">SimplicialSet</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excer